subckt dut (VDD VSS RF_IN RF_OUT VBIAS VCAS)
model NMOS bsim4 type=n
CIN (net0 RF_IN) capacitor c=1.5p
COUT (RF_OUT net1) capacitor c=1.5p
LD (VDD net1) inductor l=3.3n
LG (net4 net0) inductor l=6.8n
LS (net2 VSS) inductor l=0.8n
M1 (net3 net4 net2 VSS) NMOS l=0.18u m=1 nf=1 w=120u
M2 (net1 VCAS net3 VSS) NMOS l=0.18u m=1 nf=1 w=120u
RGB (net4 VBIAS) resistor r=1M
